<title>THAILAND: Thai trade lowers 1996/97 corn output forecast.</title>
<headline>Thai trade lowers 1996/97 corn output forecast.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai Maize and Produce Traders Association said on Wednesday it had lowered its 1996/97 (July-June) forecast for corn output to 3.96 million tonnes from a 4.23 million tonne projection made previously.</p>
<p>The association's forecast is well below that of the Thai agriculture ministry which put its preliminary projection at 4.38 million tonnes.</p>
</text>
